<title>USA: ACE Cash Express names Shipowitz CFO.</title>
<headline>ACE Cash Express names Shipowitz CFO.</headline>
<text>
<p>DALLAS, April 24 (REUTER) - ACE Cash Express Inc said Thursday it haD named Jay Shipowitz as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Shipowitz was previously chief financial officer of USDATA Corp.</p>
<p>At ACE he succeeds Thomas Larson, who left the company in November 1996.</p>
